  "brief": { "zh": "比赛结束时独占最高分。每颗彩糖和每块芯片各算一分。两台收集机抢彩糖，一台追击机在传送带间游走，一台守点机守着交叉口。第 8 和第 16 回合结束时，传送带会把没取走的条纹糖和星星糖送到新的落点。道具收完或回合用完时结算。", "en": "Finish with the highest score. Each gumball and each chip is worth one point. Two collectors chase candy, a hunter roams the conveyors and a sentry guards the crossing. After turns 8 and 16 the conveyors transfer any unclaimed Stripe and Star gumballs to new drop points. Scoring closes when time or supplies run out." },
